Error [E0851]: module alias `front` passes 1 argument(s) but alias `bound` expects 0
  --> tests/ui/genmod_alias_chain_wrong_arity.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | module front :: bound<String>
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: an alias-to-alias link reuses an already-bound module instance
 Fix: remove the arguments and write `module front :: bound`
